			)
		)
		(property "Note" "Changed 2026-10-13 from a 5-way Phoenix MC (21.6 mm) to save ~7 mm of edge: latching, keyed, and the same family and crimp tool as the cap-bank connector. Molex numbering, 1-3 on one row, 4-6 on the other: CANH (3) and CANL (6) share a column; 12 V (1) sits beside GND (2). Jumper to rev 2.1 J2: +12V_HAT -> pin 1 (+12V_RAW), GND -> pin 2, CANH/CANL -> the HAT's CAN pair; V_BCKP_AON unused on rev 2.1."
			(at 175.26 43.18 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
